## Axiom hygiene

`#assert_axioms`-clean (⊆ {propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound}); no `sorry`/`admit`/
`native_decide`. `#guard`/`decide` KATs reduce in the kernel. NEW file; imports `KimchiVerify`
